    - target: {fileID: 964927862026277184, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: RightHouse
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: map
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1896560028}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: token1
      value: I saw Jerry outside my house this morning, carrying a large basket.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: token2
      value: I heard a weird metallic noise from the basket.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: token3
      value: I put the basket under the crossbar and hung some fabrics on it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: token4
      value: Jerry told me I could borrow his basket for the day. Nothing else.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: journalId
      value: ben
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: displayName
      value: Ben
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: journalTitle
      value: Ben
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair1And2
      value: I saw the basket wobble when Jerry put it down and I heard something
        clink inside.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair1And3
      value: I saw Jerry struggling with the basket, so I helped him to carry it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair1And4
      value: Jerry told me he'd brought the basket, and I saw him doing so.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair2And3
      value: When we put the basket down, I heard something clink inside.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair2And4
      value: Jerry told me there were only clothes in the basket, but I heard something
        metallic clinking when we put it down.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair3And4
      value: Jerry asked me to return the basket tomorrow. I agreed and started unpacking.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1443764027375237223, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: journalToken1Body
