    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: token1
      value: Last time I saw the key on the desk.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: token2
      value: I heard birds singing in the morning.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: token3
      value: I packed some clothes into a basket this morning. Then I took it to
        Ben.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: token4
      value: Ben asked me if he could borrow my basket for the day.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: journalId
      value: jerry
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: I lost my key! It was there on the shelf just this morning, but now
        it's gone!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: displayName
      value: Jerry
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
