    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair1And2
      value: When I heard the birds singing, I looked outside. There was nobody except
        them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair1And3
      value: When I started packing, my key was still on the desk. I was in a hurry
        and didn't pay attention to it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair1And4
      value: Ben asked to borrow my basket. I saw him putting it between the shelves.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair2And3
      value: While I was packing the clothes, I could hear birds singing outside.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5915978795506360365, guid: 6077378f6a5ef274687b3ba67eaee406, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tokenPair2And4
